# Base URL of the RestaurantCafe web app's API (no trailing slash).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars are inlined into the app bundle at build time — this is
# not a secret, it's just the server address, same as a web app's API URL.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL="https://restaurant-cafe-restaurant-cafe.vercel.app"

# Optional: if the target deployment sits behind Vercel's SSO/Deployment
# Protection (as the current one does), requests from this app will be
# blocked the same way a plain curl request is, since a phone can't complete
# a browser SSO login either. Once a stable "Protection Bypass for
# Automation" secret is issued from the Vercel dashboard for this project,
# put it here and the API client will send it on every request.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_VERCEL_BYPASS_SECRET=""
